### Q4 against Claude

Does hedging help against a real provider, whose slow requests may be
correlated? Command: `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=... eval/hedge/claude.sh` (paid),
raw files in `eval/results/q4-hedge-claude/`.

The same comparison as the local model's, with the same hedge settings,
through the gateway's Anthropic provider to `claude-haiku-5-5`: 1 streamed
request per second (open loop), `max_tokens` 16, 60s measured after a 10s
warm-up, hedging off then on. The generator and the gateway share one
machine; the provider is the Anthropic API, so network time is in every
number.

| Hedging | Requests | Errors | TTFT p50 | p95 | p99 | p99 95% CI | Total p50 | Total p99 | Total p99 95% CI | Hedges sent / won | Extra upstream | Tokens counted (in / out) | At claude-haiku-5-5 prices |
|---------|---------:|-------:|---------:|----:|----:|-----------:|----------:|----------:|-----------------:|------------------:|---------------:|-------------------------:|-----:|
| off | 60 | 0 | 516.7 | 2023.2 | 2400.0 | 2023.2–2400.0 | 766.7 | 2650.0 | 2273.2–2650.0 | 0 / 0 | 0.0% | 980 / 1120 | $0.000658 |
| on | 60 | 0 | 440.9 | 968.1 | 1100.0 | 968.1–1100.0 | 690.9 | 1350.0 | 1218.1–1350.0 | 5 / 3 | 7.1% | 980 / 1118 | $0.000657 |

Hedging changed the TTFT p99 by -1300.0 ms (-54%) and the total p99 by -1300.0 ms (-49%).
With hedging off, the TTFT p99 was 4.6× the median. Read the two p99 intervals before reading the
change: where they overlap, this run cannot tell hedging from no hedging.

**Spend.** The gateway counted 1960 input and 2238 output tokens over
both arms (the reply each client request got), $0.001315 at `claude-haiku-5-5` list
prices. It never sees the usage of the 5 attempts cancelled when a hedge
raced them (one per hedge sent); Anthropic bills those for their prompt
and whatever they streamed before the cancel: $0.000047 if each had the mean
prompt and streamed all `max_tokens`, more than they can have streamed.
The run cost between $0.001315 and about $0.001362.

- Hardware: Test CPU @ 3.00GHz, 8 logical CPUs (GOMAXPROCS 8), linux/amd64, kernel 6.17.0, go1.27.2 (generator and gateway).
- Commit: `fixture`, run 2026-11-10T12:00:00Z. Cost: $0.001315 to about $0.001362 (above).
- Command: `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=... MODEL=claude-haiku-5-5 RATE=1 DURATION=60s WARMUP=10s MAX_TOKENS=16 eval/hedge/claude.sh`.

